OL,3,CProgramme listings for TUE 9 JUN
OL,4,G2145FThe Essay: Musicians on the Couch
OL,5,     GHow does music affect the mind?
OL,6,     GWriter Amanda Dalton explores the
OL,7,     Grelationship between the two,
OL,8,     Glooking at the connections
OL,9,     Gbetween musical creativity,
OL,10,     Gmental health and mood.
OL,11,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,12,     GHannah Peel presents an
OL,13,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,14,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,15,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,16,     Geverything in between.
OL,17,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,18,     GSoweto has another hour of
OL,19,     Gexciting new releases and jazz
OL,20,     Gclassics, and Tomeka Reid picks
OL,21,     Ganother album for her selection.
